{"id": "spent-first-approved-later", "title": "Just under $10 million first; the Board's vote came later", "seconds": 130.4, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "tempo": 1.082, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "a7d5a05ffed964a9", "words": 385, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Since 1988, the City Charter has required a Board vote on contracts expected to hit 10 million.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.28, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "The Charter rule", "sub": "since 1988"}, "emph": ["10 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.58, 1.29, 1.39, 1.61, 1.92, 2.14, 2.57, 2.68, 3.11, 3.42, 3.63, 4.22, 4.72, 4.9, 5.18, 5.42]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "In 2002, the City Attorney warned of a loophole: sign for less, then raise it later.", "t0": 6.4, "t1": 11.95, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "could avoid Board review of very large contracts"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.04, 0.18, 0.52, 1.0, 1.14, 1.3, 1.69, 2.12, 2.25, 2.34, 3.24, 3.51, 3.71, 4.33, 4.57, 4.95, 5.16]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["oneLine"], "text": "The Board’s analyst reported six deals since 2018 that started just under the line.", "t0": 12.07, "t1": 16.91, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Six cases since 2018", "sub": "just under the line, then the Board"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.36, 0.75, 1.35, 1.63, 1.98, 2.2, 2.43, 2.83, 3.18, 3.63, 3.91, 4.18, 4.31]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["oneLine"], "text": "How big did the biggest get?", "t0": 17.03, "t1": 18.64, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Six cases since 2018", "sub": "just under the line, then the Board"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.3, 0.43, 0.52, 0.84]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["oneLine", "established[4]"], "text": "94.5 million dollars.", "t0": 18.64, "t1": 21.09, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$94.5 million", "label": "Progress Foundation, December 2018"}, "emph": ["94.5"], "wt": [0.04, 0.58, 1.01, 1.31, 1.83]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "Case one.", "t0": 21.71, "t1": 22.44, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Progress Foundation", "kicker": "Case 1", "sub": "July 2018, six months", "chip": "$9,645,691"}, "wt": [0.01, 0.28]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "In 2018, the health department signed Progress Foundation for 9,645,691 dollars.", "t0": 22.56, "t1": 28.28, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Progress Foundation", "kicker": "Case 1", "sub": "July 2018, six months", "chip": "$9,645,691"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.27, 0.79, 0.94, 1.16, 1.54, 1.85, 2.36, 2.96, 3.16, 3.39, 3.64, 4.07, 4.31, 4.9]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "How long?", "t0": 28.4, "t1": 28.89, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Progress Foundation", "kicker": "Case 1", "sub": "July 2018, six months", "chip": "$9,645,691"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[10]"], "text": "Six months.", "t0": 28.89, "t1": 30.09, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "6 months", "label": "though the bid said one year", "sub": "the bidding document said a one-year first term"}, "emph": ["Six"], "wt": [0.04, 0.65]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "established[4]"], "text": "The records don’t say why.", "t0": 30.61, "t1": 31.94, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$17,973,059", "label": "projected spending that year"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.03, 0.39, 0.56, 0.84]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "established[4]"], "text": "But the department expected nearly 18 million of spending that year: 17,973,059.", "t0": 32.06, "t1": 36.67, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$17,973,059", "label": "projected spending that year"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.04, 0.13, 0.53, 1.05, 1.47, 1.87, 2.34, 2.43, 2.81, 3.01, 3.54, 3.76, 4.07]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[3]"], "text": "Case two, 2021. HealthRight 360, seven months, 9,987,371 dollars.", "t0": 36.89, "t1": 42.27, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "HealthRight 360", "kicker": "Case 2", "sub": "January 2021, seven months", "chip": "$9,987,371"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.59, 0.82, 1.7, 2.14, 2.29, 2.56, 3.26, 3.5, 4.08, 4.33, 4.59, 4.91]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "established[10]"], "text": "It paid out about 17.4 to 18 million a year.", "t0": 42.39, "t1": 46.23, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "about $17.4 million to $18 million a year"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.33, 0.48, 0.72, 1.25, 1.6, 1.9, 2.19, 2.58, 3.18, 3.39]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "established[10]"], "text": "So seven months was the only way to fit under the line.", "t0": 46.35, "t1": 48.88, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "about $17.4 million to $18 million a year"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.4, 0.69, 0.84, 0.99, 1.23, 1.44, 1.58, 1.72, 1.93, 2.06]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "established[3]"], "text": "Then it grew to 46,766,160 with no vote. The Board approved it after the fact.", "t0": 49.0, "t1": 54.28, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$46,766,160", "label": "extended to June 2023, no vote first"}, "emph": ["after the fact"], "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 0.43, 0.6, 0.74, 1.04, 1.5, 1.82, 1.93, 2.37, 2.62, 2.82, 3.32, 3.69, 3.91, 4.24, 4.44, 4.71, 4.84]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[9]"], "text": "The department’s reason in 2021: pandemic workload.", "t0": 54.4, "t1": 58.04, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "pandemic workload"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.58, 1.01, 1.14, 1.36, 1.96, 2.95]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[5]"], "text": "Case three.", "t0": 58.26, "t1": 58.91, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "just below the $10 million threshold"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[5]"], "text": "The analyst said it outright:", "t0": 59.03, "t1": 60.6, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "just below the $10 million threshold"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.57, 0.74, 0.89]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[5]"], "text": "a contract at 9,989,672 was just below the threshold.", "t0": 60.6, "t1": 64.09, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "just below the $10 million threshold"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.14, 0.69, 0.78, 1.02, 1.24, 1.74, 2.13, 2.43, 2.78, 2.95]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "established[5]"], "text": "Yet its spending was projected past the line. It later rose to 19,622,270.", "t0": 64.21, "t1": 69.47, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["the contract", "$9,989,672"], "b": ["projected spending", "$10,026,827"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.27, 0.65, 0.87, 1.41, 1.72, 1.85, 2.47, 2.7, 2.96, 3.28, 3.37, 3.61, 4.13, 4.5, 4.72]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[2]"], "text": "Case four. A workforce grant was set at 9,999,999.", "t0": 69.69, "t1": 73.05, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Bay Area Community Resources", "kicker": "Case 4", "sub": "October 2023", "chip": "$9,999,999"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.95, 1.12, 1.57, 1.85, 2.0, 2.14, 2.23, 2.52, 2.69]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[2]"], "text": "Then the office approved more spending before asking the Board. How much?", "t0": 73.17, "t1": 76.98, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Bay Area Community Resources", "kicker": "Case 4", "sub": "October 2023", "chip": "$9,999,999"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.23, 0.54, 0.99, 1.29, 1.85, 2.09, 2.45, 2.61, 3.15, 3.44]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount", "established[2]"], "text": "1,680,000 dollars.", "t0": 76.98, "t1": 79.72, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,680,000", "label": "authorised above the ceiling"}, "emph": ["1,680,000"], "wt": [0.04, 0.63, 0.82, 1.21, 1.42, 2.07]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "established[2]"], "text": "That matters because the ceiling is the most it can commit without a vote.", "t0": 80.24, "t1": 83.8, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "a policy matter"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.57, 0.87, 1.03, 1.4, 1.53, 1.7, 1.99, 2.13, 2.3, 2.72, 3.01, 3.12]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "established[2]"], "text": "The Board approved it after the fact.", "t0": 83.92, "t1": 85.68, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "a policy matter"}, "emph": ["after the fact"], "wt": [0.0, 0.03, 0.32, 0.67, 0.78, 1.13, 1.31]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["established[6]"], "text": "Cases five and six: small top-ups, called bridges.", "t0": 85.9, "t1": 89.29, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Episcopal Community Services, small top-ups", "rows": [["+$600,000", "9940476"], ["+$249,800", "9999000"]]}, "wt": [0.25, 0.37, 0.72, 0.98, 1.6, 1.9, 2.54, 2.74]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["established[6]"], "text": "600,000 dollars took one grant to 9,940,476.", "t0": 89.41, "t1": 93.7, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Episcopal Community Services, small top-ups", "rows": [["+$600,000", "9940476"], ["+$249,800", "9999000"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.4, 0.78, 1.16, 1.43, 1.62, 2.06, 2.25, 2.49, 2.79, 3.16, 3.48]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["established[6]"], "text": "249,800 took another to 9,999,000.", "t0": 93.82, "t1": 98.16, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Episcopal Community Services, small top-ups", "rows": [["+$600,000", "9940476"], ["+$249,800", "9999000"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.4, 0.92, 1.49, 1.74, 2.32, 2.61, 3.1, 3.33, 3.57, 3.8]}, {"scene": "lead6", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[7]"], "text": "Is it rare? We counted 85 deals that first passed 10 million.", "t0": 98.38, "t1": 102.44, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Our own count", "kicker": "The bigger lead", "sub": "a floor, not an official figure"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.2, 0.94, 1.2, 1.5, 2.05, 2.46, 2.68, 2.92, 3.27, 3.43]}, {"scene": "lead6", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[7]"], "text": "How many started between 9.5 and 10 million?", "t0": 102.56, "t1": 105.26, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Our own count", "kicker": "The bigger lead", "sub": "a floor, not an official figure"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.22, 0.51, 0.8, 0.98, 1.32, 1.49, 1.69, 1.85]}, {"scene": "lead6", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[7]"], "text": "57.", "t0": 105.26, "t1": 105.95, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "57", "label": "of 85", "sub": "13 within $10,000 of the line"}, "emph": ["57"], "wt": [0.04]}, {"scene": "lead6", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4].why", "notEstablished[3]"], "text": "Two-thirds, in the last half million. Our count is a floor, not an official figure.", "t0": 106.47, "t1": 110.75, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "two-thirds sit in the last half-million"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.67, 0.79, 0.9, 1.17, 1.34, 1.94, 2.17, 2.41, 2.54, 2.65, 3.21, 3.34, 3.43, 3.81]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]", "established[8]"], "text": "No authority has found any amount was picked to avoid a vote, or money misspent.", "t0": 110.97, "t1": 115.07, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any amount was chosen to avoid a vote", "That money was misspent"]}, "wt": [0.14, 0.21, 0.65, 0.81, 1.13, 1.4, 1.76, 1.9, 2.12, 2.21, 2.5, 2.58, 3.03, 3.17, 3.48]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]", "established[8]"], "text": "Below the line, there’s no comparable public review.", "t0": 115.19, "t1": 117.69, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any amount was chosen to avoid a vote", "That money was misspent"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.35, 0.68, 0.95, 1.15, 1.67, 2.04]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[1]", "next[3]"], "text": "What would settle it? Who chose those short terms, and dated histories of deals under the line.", "t0": 117.81, "t1": 122.25, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "Who chose the six- and seven-month terms"}, {"who": "", "what": "Dated histories of every contract just under the line"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.24, 0.54, 0.81, 1.06, 1.34, 1.51, 1.83, 2.29, 2.41, 2.76, 3.18, 3.3, 3.65, 3.92, 4.03]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "story[5]"], "text": "On November 3, 2026, voters raised the line to 25 million.", "t0": 122.37, "t1": 127.34, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.44, 0.92, 1.15, 2.14, 2.56, 2.83, 2.96, 3.36, 3.6, 4.29]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 127.46, "t1": 129.53, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.56, 0.7, 1.0, 1.12, 1.22, 1.44, 1.68]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "lead1": "Case 1 · six months", "lead2": "Case 2 · seven months", "lead3": "Case 3 · just below", "lead4": "Case 4 · one dollar under", "lead5": "Cases 5 and 6 · 